# API and cross-cutting

Follow `docs/cross-cutting.md`.

- Contract (DTOs / ErrorCode / envelope) before coding UI or controllers.
- Public HTTP: `/api/v1/`. Same `ApiResponse` on every endpoint.
- Docker Compose for local infra — do not add ad-hoc local DBs.
- Idempotency keys on side-effect POSTs.
- Boilerplate (`ApiResponse`, handler, Axios, ErrorBoundary) before feature code.
- Correlation ID on every request path.
